            {
              "id": "text-32",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Spinal implants are utilized for procedures involving vertebral compression, fusion, preservation of motion, stabilization etc."
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 4,
                  "text": "Metals, grades, and alloys used in this application include:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Titanium Grades/Alloys: 6AL-4V Grade 5 | 6AL-4V Eli Grade 23 | Grade 2](https://titanium.com/alloys/titanium-and-titanium-alloys/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Stainless Steel Alloys: 17-4PH | 316L | 316LVM](https://titanium.com/alloys/stainless-steel/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
