            {
              "id": "text-42",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Trauma applications includes the repair and/or alignment of a damaged or fractured bone."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium is a metal of choice in the trauma segment of the market for a number of reasons."
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 4,
                  "text": "Metals, grades, and alloysused in this application include:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Titanium Grades/Alloys: 6Al-4V Grade 5 | 6Al-4V Eli Grade 23](https://titanium.com/alloys/titanium-and-titanium-alloys/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Stainless Steel Alloys: 316L | 316LVM](https://titanium.com/alloys/stainless-steel/)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
