              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "text": "Medical Instrumentation"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "picture-46",
              "kind": "picture",
              "src": "https://titanium.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/instrumentation.jpg",
              "alt": "TI | Medical | Specialty Metals",
              "href": "",
              "wrap": "left"
            },
            {
              "id": "text-47",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium and its alloys, due to a successful combination of high strength, sufficient technological properties, small density and good corrosion resistance are gaining wider application for medical instruments production, used in general surgery, stomatology, neurosurgery, otorhinolaryngology, ophthalmology etc. The application of titanium alloys for surgical implants, micro instruments and also sets of microsurgical instruments in combination with stainless steels is most expedient."
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 4,
                  "text": "Products used in this application include:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Titanium 6Al-4V Grade 5 | 6Al-4V Eli Grade 23 | Grade 2 | Grade 4](https://titanium.com/alloys/titanium-and-titanium-alloys/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Stainless Steel Alloys 17-4PH | 316L | 316LVM](https://titanium.com/alloys/stainless-steel/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Cobalt Chrome Moly 1537](https://titanium.com/alloys/cobalt-chrome/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "To gain further insights into Titanium Industries and the diverse markets we cater to with our specialty metals, we invite you to explore our range of other markets:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Additive Manufacturing Build Plates](https://titanium.com/markets/additive-manufacturing-build-plates/) [Aerospace](https://titanium.com/markets/aerospace/) [Industrial](https://titanium.com/markets/industrial/) [Medical](https://titanium.com/markets/medical/) [Defense](https://titanium.com/markets/defense/) [Engineered Fastener Alloys](https://titanium.com/markets/engineered-fasteners/) [Consumer Products](https://titanium.com/markets/consumer-products/) [Interconnect](https://titanium.com/interconnect-alloys/)"
                },
